# lang-tools.list — small tools that help with any language
ctags           # tags for jumping to definitions
entr            # run a command when files change: ls *.c | entr make
hyperfine       # benchmark a command properly
tokei           # count lines per language in a tree
just            # a command runner: a Makefile for tasks, not builds
zeal            # offline docs for every language, searchable (docsets from 67-dev)
